  "description": "Jiyeong has a secret: she’s got a full-blown finger fetish. And unfortunately (or maybe fortunately), her best friend Garam has the most perfect shands he’s ever seen. Long, slender fingers... veins in all the right places... yes, Jiyeong is quietly fangirling over them like it’s a full-time job. But now there’s a new problem: Is it just the hands she likes… or is it Garam too? After venting to a friend over drinks, Jiyeong blacks out—only to wake up to a shirtless Garam staring down at her.\n\n*“Do you like me that much?”\n\n“…I-it’s not you! It’s your hands!!”*\n\nWhat started as a harmless little obsession is spiraling fast into chaos. Can Jiyeong separate love from... limbs?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
